                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed5b6369-1fe5-3c53-acc1-af15d4e2fb64",
                                        "entry_id": "648bb66c-0a4a-3168-bc31-74e6e6c07979",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sich mit einem Fahrzeug befahren lassen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0ef6605-2240-4cf8-985a-be95660df665",
                                                "sense_id": "ed5b6369-1fe5-3c53-acc1-af15d4e2fb64",
                                                "text": "Ein gut befahrbarer Weg führt dort hin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4932f85-f7d6-4f1c-8890-d0644f240b23",
                                                "sense_id": "ed5b6369-1fe5-3c53-acc1-af15d4e2fb64",
                                                "text": "Zurzeit ist dieser Autobahnabschnitt auf Grund eines Unfall nur einspurig befahrbar."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e1148b7-6906-43b6-91ac-40585dff9911",
                                                "sense_id": "ed5b6369-1fe5-3c53-acc1-af15d4e2fb64",
                                                "text": "Das Meer war nicht mehr befahrbar."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "acb91ce3-8a92-4675-8c20-5b4f9ec4b927",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a059e81-4da0-335d-94b3-1c246b3c7b30",
                        "source_sense_id": "4b36a3f7-6876-3191-9286-0ac1d29dd3bb",
                        "source_sense_description": "breed, diep en stromingsarm genoeg om bevaren te worden",
                        "target_lang_word": "navigable",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "navigable",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cff831e-6db2-322a-b37d-21da4c0412ba",
                                        "entry_id": "5efba6c6-1f2d-394d-bd1b-b1261c850d69",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Capable of being navigated; deep enough and wide enough to afford passage to vessels."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a body of water"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d424dfd1-25b0-4992-9ed4-cd86f002126b",
                                                "sense_id": "8cff831e-6db2-322a-b37d-21da4c0412ba",
                                                "text": "Shanghai is situated on this river, about twelve miles above Woosung; and the river is navigable for steam-boats forty-seven miles higher up—to the point where it issues from the small lake on the south of the canal. Chapoo, the town taken by the British immediately before the attack upon Woosung, is on the north side of the gulf of Che-kiang, about midway between its north cape and its innermost recess. Shanghai is the great emporium of the trade of this district with the tea-provinces on the South, with the province of Shantung and the coast of the Mantchoo Tartars on the North."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d695450f-876e-4da4-8ee7-038b8fcd2735",
                                                "sense_id": "8cff831e-6db2-322a-b37d-21da4c0412ba",
                                                "text": "[...] on July 16, 1790, a public meeting [...] unanimously approved of a scheme for making the River Soar navigable from Leicester to Loughborough, and \"a cut or rail-way from Swannington and the neighbourhood to the bason at Loughborough.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a857f46a-cb6a-33d4-9e84-35e2f1b4a2be",
                                        "entry_id": "5efba6c6-1f2d-394d-bd1b-b1261c850d69",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Seaworthy; in a navigable state; steerable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a boat"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e821097d-5b3c-3347-b5b0-3006f24a131e",
                                        "entry_id": "5efba6c6-1f2d-394d-bd1b-b1261c850d69",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Steerable, dirigible."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of a balloon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a92188ee-ae17-32cc-b526-4b45dd0a2a54",
                                        "entry_id": "5efba6c6-1f2d-394d-bd1b-b1261c850d69",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Easy to navigate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f142ae5c-dbed-4658-998d-4d99ae61c158",
                                                "sense_id": "a92188ee-ae17-32cc-b526-4b45dd0a2a54",
                                                "text": "This Web site isn't very navigable. I can't tell which image links to which page."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "72a362c7-10de-4225-9a06-1054bfe8d383",
                        "source_entry_id": "6a059e81-4da0-335d-94b3-1c246b3c7b30",
                        "source_sense_id": "4b36a3f7-6876-3191-9286-0ac1d29dd3bb",
                        "source_sense_description": "breed, diep en stromingsarm genoeg om bevaren te worden",
                        "target_lang_word": "navigable",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "navigable",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "17304971-9f79-3a33-a4ad-daa0c0f50a5c",
                                        "entry_id": "ef250005-cb90-39f0-893d-3d43ff207329",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Où l’on peut naviguer."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8182c307-6344-434e-8332-b599f57a3a81",
                                                "sense_id": "17304971-9f79-3a33-a4ad-daa0c0f50a5c",
                                                "text": "Il est d'ailleurs impossible de compter pendant les sécheresses sur la totalité du produit alimentaire parce que les riverains de la Bar profitant de ce qu'elle n'est pas considérée comme rivière navigable en amont de la prise d'eau y font de nombreuses saignées pour l'irrigation de leurs prairies ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfefa9f1-7ae2-4e0f-a11b-92be42b90998",
                                                "sense_id": "17304971-9f79-3a33-a4ad-daa0c0f50a5c",
                                                "text": "D'après la chute très-considérable de la Sée dans la commune de Brouains, où les moulins sont entassés en grand nombre dans un court espace, on ne peut pas songer à rendre la Sée navigable plus haut que Chérencé-le-Roussel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3b2f6756-ef02-47ba-915b-005561536552",
                                                "sense_id": "17304971-9f79-3a33-a4ad-daa0c0f50a5c",
                                                "text": "Autrefois le Lot était une voie navigable : ses écluses, ses relais faisaient vivre un peuple de mariniers. On a déclassé le Lot."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b958d478-8efe-4b8d-ab2a-b06ecf619d1e",
                                                "sense_id": "17304971-9f79-3a33-a4ad-daa0c0f50a5c",
                                                "text": "Les propriétaires riverains de cours d’eau non navigables ni flottables peuvent constituer une association syndicale en vue des travaux de mise en valeur piscicole de ces cours d’eau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "798d3125-cffb-46e4-8804-f3fef69e3c36",
                                                "sense_id": "17304971-9f79-3a33-a4ad-daa0c0f50a5c",
                                                "text": "[…] le fleuve Sumida est le seul du pays à mériter ce nom, preuve qu’il est navigable. Les autres fleuves japonais que j’ai pu voir ressemblent à des rivières ou à des torrents."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
